    "what_it_means": "the direction of this comparison is a property of the admission rule and not only of the counterparties. Both lists above are non-empty, so the sign of the gap turns over between the arms; and the arm whose interval clears zero is the one that asks nothing about the later window, which is also the only arm free of the selection. A report may state the committed figure, but it may not state it without this one beside it"
